WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:11.422
On a phone, the same app in one column, with 44 px touch targets.

2
00:00:11.422 --> 00:00:15.601
Indices, lists and movers stack under the chart.

3
00:00:15.601 --> 00:00:20.466
The menu drawer holds the pages, the watchlists and search.

4
00:00:20.466 --> 00:00:24.653
The stock page: chart first, details in tabs, a sticky Buy and Sell bar.

5
00:00:24.653 --> 00:00:27.252
Market depth in its own tab.

6
00:00:27.252 --> 00:00:32.167
The ticket is a bottom sheet, with depth prices to tap.

7
00:00:32.167 --> 00:00:36.159
Filled: the position strip shows quantity, average and live P&L.

8
00:00:36.159 --> 00:00:38.571
The Orders tab lists today's orders for this stock.
